>>>>> +Dynamic Device Aliasing Management
>>>>> +----------------------------------
>>>>> +
>>>>> +In addition to static device aliasing by deleting the aliasing file, F2FS
>>>>> +supports dynamic management of device aliasing. This mechanism allows the system
